{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年53歲的視后蔡少芬（Ada）與武打影星老公張晉結婚多年，投資有道的兩人手握中港至少9個優質物業、市值逼近2億港元，蔡少芬更被封為圈中樓后。</p><p>然而，近日網上突傳一家五口回流香港後「大屋搬細屋」，擠在不足900呎的單位，引發全城熱議。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.869477+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T10:01:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"ba830d75cc8990d85d790b19c1719060f2720c773b4f55ea56e8620fa41a1a05","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}